{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Search object, take it if reachable, move to destination, perform task. Else, move to destination. list of available nodes: <Action ID = SearchForObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveObjectToDestination    /> <Action ID = PerformSubTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <Condition ID = IsDestinationReached    />",
